{
  "slug": "strategy-frameworks",
  "name": "Strategy Frameworks",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Strategic Thinking Agent — meta-router for 47 business strategy frameworks (Porter Five Forces, Drucker MBO/5Q, Balanced Scorecard, Blue Ocean, Wardley Mapping, BCG Matrix, BMC, Lean Startup, OKR, Disruptive Innovation, Scenario Planning, Real Options, Game Theory, TRIZ, TOC, and more). Built on Korean business context (SME ecosystem, chaebol dynamics, regulatory environment). Invoke /think to auto-classify problems and select 1–3 optimal frameworks. Includes anti-pattern warnings for each framework.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **27 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (27): `ansoff-matrix` (Ansoff Growth Matrix — four strategic growth options: Market Penetration, Product Development, Market Development, Diversification), `bcg-matrix` (BCG Growth-Share Matrix — portfolio management framework for allocating resources across business units), `blue-ocean` (Blue Ocean Strategy (Kim & Mauborgne) — create uncontested market space instead of competing in bloody red oceans), `bmc` (Business Model Canvas (Osterwalder & Pigneur) — visualize, design, and pivot business models using 9 building blocks), `bsc` (Balanced Scorecard (Kaplan & Norton) — translate strategy into action across 4 perspectives: Financial, Customer, Internal Process, Learning…), `design-thinking` (Design Thinking (Stanford d.school / IDEO) — human-centered innovation through Empathize, Define, Ideate, Prototype, Test), `disruptive-innovation` (Disruptive Innovation (Clayton Christensen) — predict and respond to market disruption), `drucker` (Drucker's Management Frameworks (Peter Drucker) — MBO (Management by Objectives), Five Essential Questions, Effective Executive habits, Seven Sources…), and 19 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install strategy-frameworks@claude-community` from `ironyjk/strategy-frameworks`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
